# Better hunk headers for the two hand-edited pages. The migration tool has 66
# lines over 400 characters (max 1,224), so a one-word change can produce a
# diff the reviewer cannot read — which is exactly where an unrelated
# collateral edit hides.
*.html diff=html
*.css  diff=css

# Binary, so git never tries to diff or merge them.
*.woff2 binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
